      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00202:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "1-methylcyclohexene reacts with osmium tetroxide, pyridine to form osmate. This reacts with sodium hydrogen sulfite, water to form cis-1,2-diol. The reactant reacts with peroxyacid and methylene chloride to form trans-1,2-diol."
        },
